  "question": {
    "text": "If the variance of the first <math><mn>50</mn></math> odd natural numbers is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and the variance&nbsp;of next <math><mn>50</mn></math> odd natural numbers is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>,&nbsp;then <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1666",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Note that <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> (Variance is independent of shifting of orgin)<br />Now <math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>99</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>99</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>101</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>99</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2500</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3333</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>833</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1666</mn></math>",
